' Observed behavior: the reviewed PR logged selected Runtime failures but did not cover every Mate, startup, or typed execution failure.
' Architecture change: keep one failure-event contract and thin module-local boundaries; carriers contain only stable error codes.
' Design reason: operators need the original cause in service logs while callers and upper layers receive no raw error object.

@startuml campusclaw_failure_boundary
title CampusClaw Simplified Failure Boundary

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

actor Caller
participant "Failure Source" as Source
participant "Failure Boundary\nRuntimeFailures or MateInvocationFailures" as Boundary
database "Service Log\nSLF4J and ECS" as Log
participant "Code-only Carrier\nException or AssistantMessage" as Carrier
participant "Public Boundary\nHTTP or SSE" as Public

Caller -> Source : invoke operation
Source -> Source : failure detected
Source -> Boundary : original Throwable, stable code, safe context
Boundary -> Log : campusclaw.failure\noperation and errorCode\noriginal stack trace
Boundary -> Carrier : construct with errorCode only

note over Boundary, Carrier
The original Throwable never enters the carrier.
Cause is null and writable stack trace is disabled.
end note

alt Synchronous Runtime failure
  Carrier -> Public : RuntimeApiException(errorCode)
  Public --> Caller : HTTP status, resCode, localized resMsg
else Mate streaming failure
  Carrier -> Public : AssistantMessage(errorCode, errorMessage=null)
  Public --> Caller : existing stream.error contract
else Startup failure
  Carrier --> Caller : STARTUP_FAILED only
end

note over Log
No credentials, headers, prompts, message bodies,
tool payloads, upstream resMsg, or raw SSE.
end note

note over Public
Public HTTP and SSE contracts remain unchanged.
Branch on stable codes, never exception messages.
end note
@enduml
